{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up the Pieces</strong>,  <br>  <br>You hear a loud crash from the other room. A vase has fallen off the shelf. Mr Stitches' tail sweeps back and forth. Time to get to work.   <br>  <br><strong>Follow the 3 Simple Rules,</strong> <br>  <br>You lay the pieces out in front of you. There's a mixture of shapes, colours and patterns. <i>Now what?</i> Mr Stitches leaps down and brushes against your arm.  You smile and take a deep breath. A  shadowy outline appears.     <br>  <br><strong>Trust Mr Stitches.</strong>  <br>  <br>You begin thoughtfully rotating and placing the pieces. <i>Biggest  first. Start from the corners. Use them all. Remember to alternate  patterns. Solid colours mustn't touch.</i>  It comes easily at first, but you  get stuck. Mr Stitches purrs. It's a clue. <strong>Place the final piece.  A flurry of black and gold. The Kintsugi Cat.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four seasonally themed stages;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 unique, hand-crafted puzzles that  increase in complexity as you progress;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Simple Rules: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All pieces must be placed within the shaded outline; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces of the same colour must not touch; and,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solid colour pieces of any colour must not touch;</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Level Selector;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn, minimalist background art and calming music;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls optimised for Mouse or Touchpad (change in Settings);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable volume settings for music and sound;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint available in every level, just ask <strong>The Kintsugi Cat</strong>.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kintsugi Kitten","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/f24a6355e82d3787a6ac23bafff3871f4531cc36.jpg"},{"name":"Fettled Feline","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/22b88f79e73cc71a8055a31e8789577e447c5bab.jpg"},{"name":"Glazed Grimalkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/9427d1ad494e68c3ed4af5cc1d788dcfc8d818bd.jpg"},{"name":"Terracotta Tabby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/e99e28903f7093fc0bc719caa944f616b2307055.jpg"},{"name":"Porcelain Pussy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/b61c9cdd8d8256acc4a6f87cde8dbb95bf311279.jpg"},{"name":"Kintsugi Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/999c6f7a2cc9fb11afadfd9b2c912aeafd6e9025.jpg"},{"name":"Mystery Moggy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/26a434fbacba21ec0445a7cf24eee09494b8c948.jpg"},{"name":"No Hint, No Problem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/2c193baaa1ec8909d361fe3cf88929314093ef4f.jpg"},{"name":"Presto!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/09baf3214951794a40c673d14b8de0372f49207b.jpg"},{"name":"Artist As Subject","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3930830/026792eca43b86221b174aff2a9b1ae7c5a97c7f.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930830?t=1772880432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930830/cbb3c39f6d39d6fe387bfc32207f009f8b1cae94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772880432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea